=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
issue: 221
title: A pytest.toml edit that does not touch collection stays at warn
origin: issue #221: `pytest.toml` is test-runner config now, and an edit that selects nothing is a CI edit, as `pytest_ini_harmless_neg` is for `pytest.ini`
=== before: pytest.toml ===
[pytest]
minversion = "9.0"
=== after: pytest.toml ===
[pytest]
minversion = "9.0"
xfail_strict = true
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
